<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-196] The Auto-completion functionality is broken </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-196</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For all interpreters the (Ctrl+.) opens a popup menu containing some awkward suggestions  like StackOverflow ...&lt;br/&gt;
There are neither COMPLETION nor COMPLETION_LIST records in the server log which suggests that the completion event is not sent to the server. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12851377">ZEPPELIN-196</key>
            <summary>The Auto-completion functionality is broken </summary>
